        <a href="#terminal">Live Terminal</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="#download" class="btn btn-secondary">Docs</a>
        <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary glow-btn">Get NAVA OS</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-container">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        <span class="badge-text">NAVA OS v3.2 Neon Edition Released</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">The Next-Gen <span class="neon-text">Quantum-Ready</span> Operating System</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Engineered for extreme performance, autonomous AI thread orchestration, and zero-trust security. Experience seamless glassmorphic desktop computing at raw metal speed.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg glow-btn">
          <span class="btn-icon">🚀</span> Download ISO v3.2
        </a>
        <a href="#terminal" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
          <span class="btn-icon">💻</span> Launch Live Preview
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive OS Preview Window -->
      <div class="os-preview-window">
        <div class="window-header">
          <div class="window-controls">
            <span class="control close"></span>
            <span class="control minimize"></span>
            <span class="control maximize"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="window-title">nava-kernel-daemon ~ status</div>
          <div class="window-status">
            <span class="status-indicator active"></span> ONLINE
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="window-body">
          <div class="terminal-output">
            <p class="term-line"><span class="prompt">root@nava-node-01:~#</span> nava --status</p>
            <p class="term-line info">[KERNEL] NAVA Microkernel v3.2.0-release (x86_64 / ARM64)</p>
            <p class="term-line success">[SYSTEM] Neural Scheduler Active | Threads: 128 | Latency: 0.12ms</p>
            <p class="term-line success">[SECURITY] Zero-Trust Enclave Locked | Memory Protection: Quantum Enforced</p>
            <div class="metrics-row">
              <div class="metric-box">
                <span class="metric-val">0.12ms</span>
                <span class="metric-label">Context Switch</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-box">
                <span class="metric-val">99.999%</span>
                <span class="metric-label">Kernel Uptime</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-box">
                <span class="metric-val">1.2 GB</span>
                <span class="metric-label">Idle Footprint</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-box">
                <span class="metric-val">400 Gbps</span>
                <span class="metric-label">I/O Throughput</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section id="features" class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Architected for <span class="neon-text">Unmatched Speed</span></h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Built from the ground up in Rust and C++23 with zero legacy overhead.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Neural Thread Scheduler</h3>
          <p>Predicts CPU workload bottlenecks before they occur using lightweight hardware-level AI heuristics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Zero-Trust Enclaves</h3>
          <p>Every process runs inside an isolated, hardware-encrypted memory boundary with micro-permissions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-icon">💎</div>
          <h3>Glass Canvas Compositor</h3>
          <p>Hardware-accelerated GPU desktop environment running at ultra-fluid 240Hz+ frame rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🔄</div>
          <h3>Universal Package Mesh</h3>
          <p>Native execution of Linux ELF, macOS Mach-O, and WASM binaries with zero performance translation penalty.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>Quantum-Safe Network Stack</h3>
          <p>Integrated Kyber post-quantum cryptography natively protecting every socket and peer-to-peer connection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h3>Instant Snapshot Restore</h3>
          <p>Atomically checkpoint and restore the entire OS state in under 50 milliseconds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture Section -->
  <section id="architecture" class="architecture">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="arch-wrapper">
        <div class="arch-content">
          <span class="section-tag">SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE</span>
          <h2>Microkernel Microsecond Execution Core</h2>
          <p>Unlike monolithic legacy operating systems, NAVA OS isolates drivers, filesystems, and network layers into user-space micro-services. A crash in a GPU driver will never bring down your system.</p>
          <ul class="arch-list">
            <li><span>✓</span> Memory-safe Rust core kernel</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Direct NVMe & CXL memory interface</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Real-time telemetry & eBPF tracing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="arch-visual">
          <div class="arch-stack">
            <div class="stack-layer layer-app">User Applications & AI Agents</div>
            <div class="stack-layer layer-ui">Glass Canvas GUI Compositor</div>
            <div class="stack-layer layer-services">Micro-Service Drivers & IPC Mesh</div>
            <div class="stack-layer layer-kernel">NAVA Microkernel (Rust Core)</div>
            <div class="stack-layer layer-hw">Bare-Metal Hardware / Quantum Accelerator</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Download / CTA Section -->
  <section id="download" class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
